{
  "id": "0tadi9o",
  "title": "विषयवार अभ्यास प्रश्न",
  "order": 10,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "rcatvvd",
      "content": "<strong>अध्याय 10: विषयवार अभ्यास प्रश्न</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jemjj5w",
      "content": "<em>सामान्य हिन्दी + सामान्य अंग्रेज़ी — उत्तर एवं व्याख्या सहित</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "njyigzt",
      "content": "<strong>  खण्ड-A: सामान्य हिन्दी (प्रश्न 1-15)</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3498c1u",
      "content": "निर्देश: प्रत्येक प्रश्न के चार विकल्पों में से सही उत्तर चुनिए। गलत उत्तर के लिए 0.25 अंक काटे जाएंगे।"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "g3f9pob",
      "content": "<strong>Q.1. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा भाववाचक संज्ञा है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "rswpkzn",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>पानी"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "5yhk1nh",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>बचपन"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "m963dpd",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>दिल्ली"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "saankio",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>झुण्ड"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x1jcj1b",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) बचपन   Explanation: </strong><em>बचपन 'भाव/अवस्था' का नाम है — यह भाववाचक संज्ञा है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rbx703x",
      "content": "<strong>Q.2. </strong>'राम ने पत्र लिखा।' — इस वाक्य में कौन-सा वाच्य है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8huj2zl",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>कर्मवाच्य"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "1g5w8nd",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>भाववाच्य"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "bib638z",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>कर्तृवाच्य"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "p24zgpa",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>इनमें से कोई नहीं"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q2vwv8m",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) कर्तृवाच्य   Explanation: </strong><em>क्रिया का सम्बन्ध कर्ता 'राम' से है, इसलिए यह कर्तृवाच्य है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yphoexf",
      "content": "<strong>Q.3. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से 'तत्पुरुष समास' का उदाहरण कौन-सा है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qh560zn",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>यथाशक्ति"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qdbtnco",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>नीलकमल"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "xdpqd3n",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>राजपुत्र"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "eoymg3r",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>दशानन"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "verq5dl",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) राजपुत्र   Explanation: </strong><em>राजपुत्र = राजा का पुत्र — यहाँ सम्बन्ध कारक का लोप है, यह तत्पुरुष समास है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ajd7q9y",
      "content": "<strong>Q.4. </strong>'अनुभव' में कौन-सा उपसर्ग है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "vmiwwmw",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>अ"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qab526k",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>अन"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0jvlixr",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>अनु"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "klgmne9",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>अनुभ"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cntmujy",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) अनु   Explanation: </strong><em>अनु + भव = अनुभव। 'अनु' उपसर्ग का अर्थ है 'पीछे/बाद'।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "njvv2bi",
      "content": "<strong>Q.5. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से 'यण सन्धि' का उदाहरण कौन-सा है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2530gq9",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>देवेन्द्र"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "lutombp",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>विद्यालय"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "vr0b07e",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>यद्यपि"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0dix2bf",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>महैश्वर्य"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "12tdptq",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) यद्यपि   Explanation: </strong><em>यदि + अपि = यद्यपि — यहाँ इ + अ = य् (यण सन्धि)।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nwgw3v8",
      "content": "<strong>Q.6. </strong>'घड़ों पानी पड़ना' मुहावरे का अर्थ है:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "zg6pi2p",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>बहुत वर्षा होना"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ik7nig9",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>बहुत लज्जित होना"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ykljz1d",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>बहुत खुश होना"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "66pgt75",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>बहुत दुःखी होना"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jahxu3d",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) बहुत लज्जित होना   Explanation: </strong><em>यह मुहावरा अत्यधिक लज्जा या शर्मिन्दगी के लिए प्रयुक्त होता है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ffnvsgt",
      "content": "<strong>Q.7. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से शुद्ध वर्तनी कौन-सी है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "6j0avk5",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>उज्जवल"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "7j0d19u",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>उज्ज्वल"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "kl6d3u4",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>उज्जवला"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "g2u62jx",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>उज्ज्वला"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rhemgy1",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) उज्ज्वल   Explanation: </strong><em>सही वर्तनी 'उज्ज्वल' है — उज् + ज्वल।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9wv3fir",
      "content": "<strong>Q.8. </strong>'मुख चन्द्रमा सा सुन्दर है' — इसमें कौन-सा अलंकार है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "9xn9qg8",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>रूपक"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "czcmt8w",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>उत्प्रेक्षा"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "09g0fd9",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>उपमा"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "jsi7uqh",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>अनुप्रास"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tp3t0kk",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) उपमा   Explanation: </strong><em>उपमेय (मुख) की उपमान (चन्द्रमा) से तुलना 'सा' वाचक के साथ — यह उपमा अलंकार है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "khtg90y",
      "content": "<strong>Q.9. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से 'जल' का तत्सम रूप क्या है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "6tc23p9",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>नीर"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "nleu7q5",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>वारि"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "k4x2niv",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>जलम्"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "xhf7yf4",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>उदक"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z6w3z1h",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (D) उदक   Explanation: </strong><em>जल का संस्कृत/तत्सम रूप 'उदक' है, जबकि नीर और वारि पर्यायवाची हैं।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qgqze4t",
      "content": "<strong>Q.10. </strong>'कर्म कारक' की विभक्ति कौन-सी है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "op0vw8a",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>ने"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "a62ys98",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>से"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ben1scf",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>को"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "thzkw86",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>में"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "olidt8k",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) को   Explanation: </strong><em>कर्म कारक की विभक्ति चिह्न 'को' है। जैसे — मोहन को बुलाओ।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ylf76cb",
      "content": "<strong>Q.11. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से 'अव्ययीभाव समास' का उदाहरण है:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tkefdfk",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>नवरात्र"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "yzfa3wz",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>प्रतिदिन"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0wo8lel",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>राधा-कृष्ण"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8fdu0pe",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>नीलकमल"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vc6bv3y",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) प्रतिदिन   Explanation: </strong><em>प्रति + दिन — पूर्वपद 'प्रति' अव्यय है, यह अव्ययीभाव समास है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vvqr3el",
      "content": "<strong>Q.12. </strong>'सत्य' का विलोम शब्द क्या है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "hwk17vw",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>झूठ"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "7a0nqhf",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>कपट"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "33r17xf",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>असत्य"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "7ofqovv",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>मिथ्या"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oy6u820",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) असत्य   Explanation: </strong><em>परीक्षा में शुद्ध विलोम 'असत्य' माना जाता है, जो उपसर्ग से बना है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vno9dgu",
      "content": "<strong>Q.13. </strong>निम्नलिखित में से 'श्रृंगार रस' का स्थायी भाव क्या है?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "efdk8at",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>उत्साह"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "xumt7d4",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>हास"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "car54xn",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>रति"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "06h6sqp",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>क्रोध"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9jwsx6p",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) रति   Explanation: </strong><em>श्रृंगार रस का स्थायी भाव 'रति' (प्रेम) है।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zc8m7ov",
      "content": "<strong>Q.14. </strong>'वाक् + ईश' की सन्धि क्या होगी?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "85l6uiv",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>वाकीश"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "kevjgd6",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>वागीश"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "i2zoej0",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>वाक्ईश"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "3m7sy4e",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>वाचीश"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mps0m3o",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) वागीश   Explanation: </strong><em>व्यञ्जन सन्धि में क् + घोष ई → ग् हो जाता है, अतः वागीश।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pafnm8p",
      "content": "<strong>Q.15. </strong>'जो पहले कभी न हुआ हो' के लिए एक शब्द है:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "w94915s",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>अद्वितीय"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "e8zqanw",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>अभूतपूर्व"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "uq7xv4q",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>अनुपम"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "6dhi5so",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>असाधारण"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "etitl7x",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) अभूतपूर्व   Explanation: </strong><em>अभूतपूर्व = जो भूतकाल में पूर्व (पहले) न हुआ हो।</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "a6wpnb7",
      "content": "<strong>  खण्ड-B: सामान्य अंग्रेज़ी (प्रश्न 16-23)</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u52wd1s",
      "content": "Directions: Choose the most appropriate option for each question."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1pno8nz",
      "content": "<strong>Q.16. </strong>Choose the correct passive voice: 'She sings a song.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xdli92r",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>A song is sung by her."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wh1ou28",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>A song was sung by her."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "78nlg9k",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>A song is being sung."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "31fy4j9",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>A song has been sung by her."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fb0ba6t",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (A) A song is sung by her.   Explanation: </strong><em>Simple Present Active → Simple Present Passive: is/am/are + V3 + by agent.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x0sx0tj",
      "content": "<strong>Q.17. </strong>Find the error: 'He is one of the best player in the team.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "eju7hip",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>He is"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "9a8uc6s",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>one of the best"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "wuz8r55",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>player in"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "71gx82z",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>the team"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lucnvsw",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) player in   Explanation: </strong><em>'One of the best' is always followed by a plural noun. Correct: 'players in the team'.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ygqlhtv",
      "content": "<strong>Q.18. </strong>Choose the correct indirect speech: He said, 'I will help you.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pa57r9y",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>He said that he will help me."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0wt0lqs",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>He said that he would help me."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tgupr9t",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>He told that he would help me."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vbvfunt",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>He said that he helped me."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "726oec0",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) He said that he would help me.   Explanation: </strong><em>Will → Would in indirect speech (past reporting verb).</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "si6sn0d",
      "content": "<strong>Q.19. </strong>The synonym of 'Sagacious' is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "jiuya25",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>Brave"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cqag47e",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>Wise"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "522nbyu",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>Generous"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "e7aw0ax",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>Calm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "iu1ko1r",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) Wise   Explanation: </strong><em>Sagacious means having good judgment; hence 'wise' is the correct synonym.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5wx5e2v",
      "content": "<strong>Q.20. </strong>Choose the correctly spelled word:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "l90sar2",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>Accomodation"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "4nau9qx",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>Acommodation"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cdzehqd",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>Accommodation"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "o2ai1p9",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>Accomodtion"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tznoe9i",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) Accommodation   Explanation: </strong><em>Accommodation has double 'c' and double 'm': ac-com-mo-da-tion.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bf050gz",
      "content": "<strong>Q.21. </strong>'Beat around the bush' means:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ugyz5ag",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>To hit a bush"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "get1lhj",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>To avoid the main topic"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2oa3ooa",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>To work hard"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "3drch95",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>To move quickly"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ozsz0ku",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) To avoid the main topic   Explanation: </strong><em>This idiom means to avoid getting to the point.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dtrbqx7",
      "content": "<strong>Q.22. </strong>Fill in the blank: 'Neither he nor his friends ___ present.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8ds3i3h",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>was"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Direct questions often test basic terminology and fundamental definitions in preliminary stages.",
        "Conceptual clarity established in introductory modules is crucial for solving multi-statement questions."
